{
  "experiment": "m5_lens_form",
  "description": "Fits LENS's per-bucket linear model (intercept + slope*length) on TPU across bucket AND batch size, to test whether our 6.11 ms fixed cost -- measured only at n=1, this project's known-degenerate regime -- is actually a constant. The paper's crossover result depends on it being one. A third mid-bucket point per cell is measured but withheld from the fit, so LENS's protocol can be validated against its stated 2.15% on hardware it never ran on.",
